{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And I will bring you to the land.</b> For many of those who came out of Egypt — their children too are counted among them." "And the sense of \"which I lifted up My hand\" is by way of parable, like a person who lifts his hand toward heaven and swears, as in \"For I will lift up My hand to heaven\" (Deuteronomy 32:40), \"and he lifted up his right hand and his left toward heaven\" (Daniel 12:7)." "And the sense of \"I am YHWH\" is: I will fulfill this."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:07.365774750Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}